ies for Roblox sign-in (10 and 15 minutes), plus your theme and wallet choice in your browser.</p></section><section class="px-5 py-5"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Contact</h2><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-body">Questions or deletion requests: hello@bloxpad.io.</p></section></div></div><footer class="mt-14 border-t border-border pt-5 text-[12px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground"><p>bloxpad is not affiliated with or endorsed by Roblox Corporation. Coins launch on pump.fun and are highly speculative.</p><p class="mt-1">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->bloxpad<!-- --> · 18+ only ·<!-- --> <a class="hover:underline" href="/terms">Terms</a> <!-- -->·<!-- --> <a class="hover:underline active" href="/privacy" data-status="active" aria-current="page">Privacy</a> <!-- -->·<!-- --> <a href="mailto:hello@bloxpad.io" class="hover:underline">hello@bloxpad.io</a></p></footer></div></main></div><nav class="fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-40 grid h-[62px] grid-cols-5 border-t border-border bg-card/95 pb-[env(safe-area-inset-bottom)] backdrop-blur-md md:hidden"><a class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-muted-foreground" href="/"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-house size-[22px]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8"></path><path d="M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-6a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 6A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path></svg>Home</a><a class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-muted-foreground" href="/discover"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-compass size-[22px]" aria-hidden="true"><circle c